<title>CANADA: Western Star Trucks to issue 1 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Western Star Trucks to issue 1 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>KELOWNA, British Columbia 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Star Trucks Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it agreed with underwriters to buy and sell to the public one million common shares at a price of C$40.65 per common share for gross proceeds of C$40,650,000.</p>
<p>Closing was expected by October 3, Western Star said.</p>
<p>It said net proceeds of the issue would be used for working capital and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
